OL,3,GNEWSABallots cast in election to be
OL,4,Arecounted
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe high court in the Isle of Man is
OL,7,Fset to order a full recount of the
OL,8,Fballots for one constituency in the
OL,9,Frecent House of Keys general election.
OL,11,FIt follows a petition to the court by
OL,12,Fformer Onchan MHK Julie Edge, who lost
OL,13,Fher seat in September's contest, after
OL,14,Ffigures showed 79 ballots were
OL,15,Funaccounted for.
OL,17,FThe petition calls for the court to
OL,18,Fdeclare the election void, which would
OL,19,Flead to a new election being held.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,451,445,260,140,0,100
