OL,3,GNEWSABallots cast in election to be
OL,4,Arecounted
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt a hearing at Douglas Courthouse,
OL,7,FFirst Deemster Andrew Corlett called
OL,8,Fthe situation "very unprecedented"
OL,9,Fpointing out the court had not dealt
OL,10,Fwith an election petition before, and
OL,11,Fthe recount would take place first with
OL,12,Fthe rest of the petition dealt with
OL,13,Fafterwards.
